## 1. Purpose

This policy sets Contoso Demo Bank commercial real estate (CRE) underwriting limits. The owning committee is the {{ facts.owning_committee_cre }}.

## 2. Scope

Applies to stabilized income-producing CRE and CRE construction facilities. Land-only loans follow Construction and Development (CP-CND-2026-01). Climate overlays in CP-ESG-2026-01 may tighten LTV.

## 3. Thresholds

- Maximum LTV for stabilized CRE is {{ facts.max_ltv_stabilized_cre }}.
- Minimum DSCR for stabilized commercial real estate is {{ facts.min_dscr_stabilized_cre }}.
- Construction maximum LTV is {{ facts.max_ltv_construction_cre }}.
- Interest-only period on CRE may not exceed {{ facts.interest_only_max_cre }}.
- Underwriting must apply a vacancy stress of {{ facts.vacancy_stress }}.

## 4. Authority

The {{ facts.owning_committee_cre }} owns this policy. Climate-risk LTV reductions in the ESG overlay are more specific than the stabilized CRE LTV in this document.

## 5. Related policies

See Climate and ESG Overlay (CP-ESG-2026-01), Construction and Development (CP-CND-2026-01), and Collateral Valuation (CP-COL-2026-01).
